sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant LB as Round-robin LB
  participant A as Server A
  participant B as Server B
  C->>LB: tools/call (delete_files)
  LB->>A: forwards
  A-->>C: input_required (+ requestState blob)
  Note over C: ask the user "Delete 3 files?"
  C->>LB: retry (inputResponses + same blob)
  LB->>B: lands on a DIFFERENT box
  B-->>C: complete (rebuilt from the blob)
